. * HYPOTHESIS TEST FOR H1 * (Please adapt according to your needs)
. 
.         * Please add a verbal description of your model here
.         
.         * We consider the variable GenderAttitude a suitable measure of suppo
> rt for 
.         * gender equality, where higher values indicate greater support. To e
> stimate 
.         * the effect of having at least one daughter on gender attitudes, we 
> conduct 
.         * an instrumental variable (IV) estimation using linear OLS regressio
> n. 
.         * Specifically, we instrument the variable HasDaughter with first_dau
> ghter 
.         * that indicates if the first born child is a daughter.
. 
.         ivreg2 GenderAttitude (has_daughter = first_daughter) $controls if pa
> rental_age >= 10, robust

